---
description: Keep vendor LLM SDKs out of the agent loop and domain port.
globs: src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: true
---

# LLM provider port

Discovery describes **what** to ask a model (`LlmRequest` / `LlmResponse`). Vendor SDKs describe **how**.

## Forbidden

These modules must not import `openai` or `@anthropic-ai/sdk`:

- `src/domain/`
- `src/agent/`
- `src/replay/`
- `src/artifact/`
- `src/safety/`
- `src/escalate/`

Replay must not take `LlmProvider` at all.

## Allowed

- `src/llm/openai/` — official OpenAI SDK
- `src/llm/anthropic/` — Anthropic adapter
- `src/cli.ts` — `resolveLlmProvider()` and pass `LlmProvider` into discover

## Signatures

Bad:

```ts
function nextAction(client: OpenAI, messages: ChatCompletionMessageParam[])
```

Good:

```ts
function nextAction(llm: LlmProvider, messages: LlmMessage[]): Promise<ActPayload>
```
